title: "IEPP: Policy-Relative Canonical Continuation for Copyable AI Agents"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Seo"
    given-names: "Woocheol"
repository-code: "https://github.com/swc8121-alt/iepp"
url: "https://entropyproof.com/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-08
abstract: >-
  IEPP is a registry-relative research protocol, conceived and developed by
  Woocheol Seo, for testing whether an AI agent or other enrolled digital
  entity presents the next policy-authorized continuation of a previously
  accepted execution lineage.
keywords:
  - AI agent identity
  - AI agent continuity
  - execution continuity
  - digital entity identity
  - canonical lineage
  - policy-relative continuation
  - challenge-response
